  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "歷史社會：資本主義的誕生",
    "sub_ename": "HISTORICAL SOCIOLOGY ： THE BIRTH OF CAPITALISM",
    "describe_ch": "在常態的社會中，人們習慣以眼前所見作為判斷的依據。本課程透過布勞岱的「長時段」(long-duration)觀點，重新思考是那些不被看見、不被重視的東西，在漫長的時間裡逐漸演化出我們習以為常的經濟生活環境。這樣的學習，將協助我們掌握到社會變遷的趨勢，有利於理解世界為何是這樣！未來將會是怎樣！",
    "describe_eh": "In a normal society, people are accustomed to using what they see at the moment as the basis for judgment. Through Fernand Braudel“long-duration” perspective, this course rethinks what is not seen and valued, and gradually evolves the economic living environment that we are accustomed to over a long period of time. This kind of study will help us grasp the trend of social changes and help us understand why the world is the way it is! What will be in the future!",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
